        "headline": "國籍航空國際航線燃油附加費8月9日起調漲",
        "summary": "交通部民用航空局表示，因近期航空燃油價格上漲，國籍航空公司國際航線客運燃油附加費將自8月9日起調漲。依中油公告油價，短程航線附加費由27.5美元調漲至30美元，長程航線由71.5美元調漲至78美元。民航局已要求業者充分揭露資訊，以維護消費者權益。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan CAA Announces International Airline Fuel Surcharge Increases From August 9",
        "summary_en": "Taiwan's Civil Aeronautics Administration announced that passenger fuel surcharges on international flights operated by Taiwanese airlines will increase starting August 9, 2026, due to rising jet fuel prices. Based on international aviation fuel prices announced by CPC Corporation, the surcharge tier moved from level 11 to level 12. Surcharges for short-haul international flights will increase from $27.50 to $30, while long-haul flight surcharges will rise from $71.50 to $78. The aviation authority has asked airlines to disclose relevant information to protect consumer interests.",
